== Overview ==
The '''Mutant Toilet 2.0''' is a stronger version of The [[Mutant Toilet]]. It has much more health than its original version, and has an ability where it can stun units by punching them for about 2 seconds. It wears headphones and a hat. 

== Health: 256,000 ==

=== Hard Mode ===
Wave 23: x2

=== Nightmare Mode ===
Wave 13:  x1

== Strategy ==
Mutant Toilet 2.0 is not a hard enemy to fight despite having 256.000 hp

